 Here is what will change                                                in C:\Projects\quiz-slayer

 In C:\Projects\quiz-slayer and every folder inside it, Git will commit as You <you@work.example>.
 Everywhere else stays You <you@personal.example>.

 Devpit will write:
   ~/AppData/Roaming/devpit/accounts.toml (adds)
     [[rule]]
     folder = 'C:\Projects\quiz-slayer'
     git = "work"

